msgid "Complete CAPTCHA solution with support for reCAPTCHA v2, v3, Cloudflare Turnstile, hCaptcha, and ALTCHA. Protect WordPress, WooCommerce, BuddyPress, bbPress, and popular form builders from spam and bots with a modular, easy-to-manage interface."
